# Build output.
/target

# Orchestrator worker scratch: inputs (task.md, diff.patch) and outputs
# (result.md, findings.jsonl, progress.jsonl, DONE) live here. The orchestrator
# reads them straight off the workspace filesystem; they must never be snapshot
# into the Implementer's change, or they would land on `main` (REQ-3, REQ-17).
/_orchestrator/

# Orchestrator runtime state, written to `.orchestrator/` in the repo root
# (state.db, events.jsonl, heartbeat-*.json). Same bug class as the worker
# scratch above: a QA or landing run must not snapshot these into a change. The
# committed `.orchestrator/static_qa.sh` is whitelisted back in below.
/.orchestrator/*
!/.orchestrator/static_qa.sh
